#: 82bdd1c5ebe2466cad640c32316c9ea8
msgid "Increase the D gain in increments of 0.001 until it it starts to oscillate, then halve it. Be sure to check the temperature of your servos when you land as in extreme cases turning up this gain can cause rapid servo movement and overheat the servos leading to premature failure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:135
#: 96c81819787a4688afa0a154780d10ce
msgid "You can sometimes then go back and increase P gain a bit more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:138
